"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 口臭仍有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 高血壓已正常（120/88），已不服西药"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 口臭仍有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好多了，半夜不醒來，6：30起床"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日1次，大便稀，排氣較以前多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、手足溫："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手温足有時蓋被"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右緩細，左緩"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：\n2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 同前"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 同4月2日方，改炮附子四錢，今日方如下："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子四錢 ，補骨脂三錢，澤瀉四錢，巴戟天三錢，豬苓三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丹皮三錢，黃芩三錢，大黃二錢，細辛一錢，炙甘草五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連二錢，桂枝三錢，麥冬五錢，黃芪五錢  十付 九碗水煮成三碗 早晚餐前服 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大黄片（泡水） 七片"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}